<p>Sesame prices move with Indian harvest size, competing supply from African origins (Sudan, Ethiopia, Nigeria, Tanzania), and demand from Chinese and Japanese buyers. Hulled carries a processing premium over natural. Send your type, purity grade, quantity and destination port for a current quote.</p>

